{
  "title": "技术干货 | GreatSQL MGR优化参考",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>13</span><font>2021.04</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>技术干货 | GreatSQL MGR优化参考</h2> <b>2021.04.13</b> <h3 style=\"margin: 30px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; font-size: 20px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">. 前言</h3><blockquote style=\"margin: 20px 0px; padding: 10px 10px 10px 20px; border-left: 3px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); color: rgb(106, 115, 125); font-size: 0.9em; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; overflow: auto; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.047); font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: black; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">GreatSQL运行更平稳，不会有大的抖动。MySQL官方版本的MGR更适合在中小规模业务环境下运行。</p></blockquote><h3 style=\"margin: 30px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; font-size: 20px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">1. GreatSQL的优势</h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">GreatSQL的优势在于提升了MGR的性能、可靠性并修复了众多bug。主要有以下几点：</p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 25px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><li><section>提升大事务并发性能及稳定性</section></li><li><section>优化MGR队列garbage collect机制、改进流控算法，以及减少每次发送数据量，避免性能抖动</section></li><li><section>解决了AFTER模式下，存在节点加入集群时容易出错的问题</section></li><li><section>在AFTER模式下，强一致性采用多数派原则，以适应网络分区的场景</section></li><li><section>当MGR节点崩溃时，能更快发现节点异常状态，有效减少切主和异常节点的等待时间</section></li><li><section>修复了可能导致数据丢失、性能抖动等多个缺陷/bug问题</section></li></ul><h3 style=\"margin: 30px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; font-size: 20px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">2. GreatSQL MGR优化建议</h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">为了能更好的发挥出GreatSQL运行MGR的优势，有几个优化建议：</p><h4 style=\"margin: 30px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">2.1 关闭流控</h4><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">GreatSQL MGR相较于官方版本，在从库回放速度控制方面做得更优雅、更完善。因此，建议直接在事务并发量不是太高的场景下，关闭流控模式，让GreatSQL发挥出更大性能优势。</p><pre style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; overflow: auto; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55) 0px 2px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><code style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 16px 16px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Operator Mono&quot;, Consolas, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; display: -webkit-box; overflow-x: auto; color: rgb(171, 178, 191); background: rgb(40, 44, 52); border-radius: 5px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(92, 99, 112); font-style: italic; line-height: 26px;\">#&nbsp;QUOTA&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;开启流控（默认）</span><br/><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(92, 99, 112); font-style: italic; line-height: 26px;\">#&nbsp;DISABLED&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;关闭流控</span><br/>group_replication_flow_control_mode&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(152, 195, 121); line-height: 26px;\">&quot;DISABLED&quot;</span><br/></code></pre><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">通常来说，不建议开启流控。当然了，如果实际生产环境中，已经快达到了服务器的硬件性能极限，这种情况下，还是要开启流控的，只不过可以把默认的流控阈值调高一些，比如设置为原来的10倍或更高。此外，在正式上线前的压测环境下，也最好关闭流控，通过压测得到事务性能指标和服务器性能的一个平衡点。这就类似另一个参数&nbsp;<code style=\"margin: 0px 2px; padding: 2px 4px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Operator Mono&quot;, Consolas, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; border-radius: 4px; color: rgb(30, 107, 184); background-color: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.047); word-break: break-all;\">innodb_thread_concurrency</code>，通常也不建议设置为非0，以避免在高并发场景下，InnoDB线程总是要等待排队，反倒影响并发性能。</p><h4 style=\"margin: 30px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; font-size: 18px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">2.1 修改从库回放并发度</h4><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">为了提高MGR从库的回放效率，降低从库延迟，需要提高从库回放线程数。</p><pre style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; overflow: auto; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55) 0px 2px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><code style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 16px 16px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Operator Mono&quot;, Consolas, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; display: -webkit-box; overflow-x: auto; color: rgb(171, 178, 191); background: rgb(40, 44, 52); border-radius: 5px;\">slave_parallel_type&nbsp;=&nbsp;LOGICAL_CLOCK<br/>slave_parallel_workers&nbsp;=&nbsp;128&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(92, 99, 112); font-style: italic; line-height: 26px;\">#回放线程数可以设置为逻辑CPU的4倍甚至更高</span><br/></code></pre><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">剩下的就是正常的MySQL优化套路了，下面是几个关键参数列表，建议根据硬件配置级别适当调整：</p><pre style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; overflow: auto; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55) 0px 2px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><code style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 16px 16px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Operator Mono&quot;, Consolas, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; display: -webkit-box; overflow-x: auto; color: rgb(171, 178, 191); background: rgb(40, 44, 52); border-radius: 5px;\">innodb_buffer_pool_size&nbsp;=&nbsp;128G<br/>innodb_buffer_pool_instances&nbsp;=&nbsp;8<br/>innodb_log_file_size&nbsp;=&nbsp;2G<br/>innodb_log_files_in_group&nbsp;=&nbsp;3<br/>innodb_io_capacity&nbsp;=&nbsp;20000<br/>innodb_io_capacity_max&nbsp;=&nbsp;40000<br/>innodb_flush_sync&nbsp;=&nbsp;OFF<br/></code></pre><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">此外，也强烈建议采用&nbsp;<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">jemalloc</strong>&nbsp;代替系统自带的内存分配机制。</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">最后放一张在大流量、高负载的业务场景下的压测对比图，充分体现了GreatSQL的优势（由不愿透露姓名的社区朋友提供）</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">我们再次诚邀更多的朋友们一起使用GreatSQL，更放心的用上MGR，提高数据库服务可用时间，保证业务可靠性。</p><h3 style=\"margin: 30px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; font-size: 20px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">3. 关于GreatSQL</h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">GreatSQL是源于Percona server的分支版本，除了Percona Server已有的稳定可靠、高效、管理更方便等优势外，特别是进一步提升了MGR（MySQL Group Replication）的性能及可靠性，以及众多bug修复。</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 8px 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; line-height: 26px; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">GreatSQL可以作为MySQL或Percona server的可选替代方案，用于线上生产环境。</p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 25px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; font-family: Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><li><section>gitee官网：<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-decoration-line: underline; color: rgb(0, 82, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">https://gitee.com/GreatSQL/GreatSQL</span></section></li><li>